who is a guy called Francois Pinaar, getting Pinar on board with the exciting, progressive new slogan for the South African rugby team, one team, one country. And Pinar is essentially what AI would come up with if you typed in Africana rugby player. You know, he doesn't really look like Matt Damon who plays him in Invictus and who just looks so unbelievably American. It's not true. Pinar looks very, very South African. He looks incredibly hard, doesn't he? He's from a working-class transvaal family. So he's from one of the kind of great Afrikanah heartlands.
一个叫弗朗索瓦·皮纳尔（Francois Pienaar）的人，让皮纳尔加入南非橄榄球队那个令人兴奋、进步的新口号：“一个团队，一个国家”（One team, one country）。皮纳尔基本上就是如果你输入“阿非利卡橄榄球运动员”AI会给出的形象。你知道，他看起来并不像在《成事在人》中饰演他的马特·达蒙，后者看起来太不可思议地美国化了。那不是真的。皮纳尔看起来非常、非常南非。他看起来极其强硬，不是吗？他来自一个工人阶级的德兰士瓦家庭。所以他来自阿非利卡人的核心地带之一。

