00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:52.000
And he looks like it's hewn out of wood or something. Very blonde, incredibly tall, gigantic, an absolute alpha male. But he's very smart. He's educated. And he's a deeply Christian man. And he is invited to the presidential palace for tea meets Mandela. Is completely charmed by Mandela. And Mandela, in turn, is very impressive.
他看起来像是用木头雕刻出来的。非常金发，高得不可思议，巨大，绝对的阿尔法男性。但他很聪明。他受过教育。而且他是一个虔诚的基督徒。他被邀请到总统府喝茶，见到了曼德拉。完全被曼德拉的人格魅力所折服。而曼德拉反过来也对他印象深刻。

