throwing their phones across the room because they will tell you, Tom, that their team were poisoned before the game, they had food poisoning. So like Gordon Banks. Yeah, well, much more than Gordon Banks. So a lot of the team, they say had food poisoning. They were poisoned by the South Africans, and that's what the South Africans want. Now, at this point, South African listeners will be going mad.
把手机扔过房间，因为他们会告诉你，汤姆，他们的球队在比赛前被下毒了，他们食物中毒了。就像戈登·班克斯（Gordon Banks）那样。是的，比戈登·班克斯的情况严重得多。所以他们说球队里的很多人食物中毒了。他们被南非人下毒了，而这就是南非人想要的。现在，此时南非听众会气疯的。

